OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need support helps
OL,4,Achange young lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FJasmine was just four years old when
OL,7,Fshe moved from Nigeria to Devon, and
OL,8,Fsaid she found "fitting in" difficult.
OL,10,F"I found fitting in a bit hard because
OL,11,Fpeople might think it's strange about
OL,12,Fmy skin colour and how I come from a
OL,13,Fdifferent part of the world," she said.
OL,15,FShe said BBC Children in Need-backed
OL,16,Fgroup Young Voices Inspire, which is
OL,17,Frun by Plymouth Jollof Kitchen, helped
OL,18,Fher feel part of her community.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
