OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need support helps
OL,4,Achange young lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow Jasmine is set to perform as part
OL,7,Fof the BBC Children in Need Choir where
OL,8,Fthey will appear live on BBC One's
OL,9,FAppeal Show on Friday.
